{
  "description": "AI-Pack Framework Configuration for Claude Code",
  "_comment_permissions": "defaultMode: acceptEdits — auto-approve Write/Edit/safe Bash. Require approval: git commit/push/merge, rm, destructive operations. gh api graphql:* is intentionally auto-approved for the pr-feedback-loop skill (resolveReviewThread mutation); other mutations are incidental and cannot be blocked at this level of granularity. Scoped REST patterns for PR review reads and thread replies are also included.",
  "_comment_issue_commands": "gh issue view:* and gh issue list:* are read-only and are used by the Inspector role to look up and cross-reference GitHub issues during bug investigations.",
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Write(*)",
      "Edit(*)",
      "Bash(mkdir:*)",
      "Bash(agent:*)",
